  "identifier": "mirth-connect",
  "name": "Mirth Connect",
  "description": "The most widely used open-source healthcare integration engine — routes, transforms, and filters health messages between clinical systems across HL7 v2, HL7 v3, FHIR, XML, JSON, DICOM, and other formats. Manages message pathways (channels) through a visual Administrator interface. Used by hospitals, clinics, and health information exchanges to connect EMRs, labs, pharmacies, imaging systems, and billing platforms. Maintained by NextGen Healthcare; MPL 2.0 licensed. 1.2k stars, 449 forks, v4.5.2.",
  "url": "https://www.nextgen.com/solutions/interoperability/mirth-integration-engine/mirth-connect-downloads",
